The dates in the table and the paragraph above are the plan's dates at the plan's capacity (one account per AI company, about {{planning.days_a_week}} agent working days a week). They are not dates for today's conditions. They come from rolling the {{fc.planning.tasks}} tasks of the task breakdown {{fc.planning.sims}} times with seed {{fc.plan_seed}}; the {{tasks_left_out}} measuring task added after that is not in them. Changing nothing but the seed, {{fc.n_seeds}} times, moves the middle date of the direction-fixing gate between {{fc.planning.g_dir_p50.earliest}} and {{fc.planning.g_dir_p50.latest}} and its {{pct80}}% date between {{fc.planning.g_dir_p80.earliest}} and {{fc.planning.g_dir_p80.latest}}. The middle date of 1.0 moves between {{fc.planning.rel_10_p50.earliest}} and {{fc.planning.rel_10_p50.latest}} ({{fc.planning.rel_10_p50.weeks_apart}} weeks apart) and its {{pct80}}% date between {{fc.planning.rel_10_p80.earliest}} and {{fc.planning.rel_10_p80.latest}} ({{fc.planning.rel_10_p80.weeks_apart}} weeks apart). The dates are to be read with that width. The middle date without Google, run {{fc.two_companies.sims}} times with each of {{fc.n_seeds}} seeds, likewise moves between {{fc.two_companies.rel_10_p50.earliest_month}} and {{fc.two_companies.rel_10_p50.latest_month}}.

From {{date_long}}, for the time being, we work with one Claude account only, and that account is shared with the owner's other work. We count this as about {{claude_shared.days_a_week}} agent working days a week, and an account used for Dodam alone as about {{claude_dedicated.days_a_week}}. Neither is a measured value; both are assumptions. Running the same simulation {{fc.claude_shared.sims}} times with each of {{fc.n_seeds}} seeds, the middle date for 1.0 under today's conditions kept to the end lies between {{fc.claude_shared.rel_10_p50.earliest_month}} and {{fc.claude_shared.rel_10_p50.latest_month}}, depending on the seed, and between {{fc.claude_dedicated.rel_10_p50.earliest_month}} and {{fc.claude_dedicated.rel_10_p50.latest_month}} with the account used for Dodam alone. In both cases the {{pct80}}% date is later than {{fc.last_month}}, where the simulation stops. The dates the earlier version gave (Claude alone {{v07.claude_alone.p50}}, shared {{v07.claude_shared.p50}}, two companies {{v07.two_companies.p50}}) are values of one seed ({{v07.seed}}) run {{v07.sims}} times; that computation is now in the repository and gives them again exactly with one command. That computation and the ranges above have the same measurement settings and the same number of runs, and neither has the numbers of the trial run in it; they differ only in the seed and in the way the capacity is set. That the earlier date for Claude alone lies outside the range above comes from the seed. It was the third of four cases drawn one after another from one seed; drawn first from that same seed, this case gives {{v07.claude_alone.drawn_first_month}}. With {{v07.n_seeds}} seeds the middle date moves between {{v07.claude_alone.plan_scenario_scaled.earliest_month}} and {{v07.claude_alone.plan_scenario_scaled.latest_month}} set the way the ranges above are, and between {{v07.claude_alone.own_scenario.earliest_month}} and {{v07.claude_alone.own_scenario.latest_month}} set the earlier way ({{v07.claude_alone.own_scenario_more_runs.earliest_month}} to {{v07.claude_alone.own_scenario_more_runs.latest_month}} with {{v07.more_sims}} runs each). The range over {{fc.n_seeds}} seeds is narrower than the real width. With the values measured in the trial run entered, the direction-fixing gate has under today's conditions a middle date of {{claude_shared.after_x1.g_dir.p50}} and a {{pct80}}% date of {{claude_shared.after_x1.g_dir.p80}} (a chance of {{claude_shared.after_x1.p_gate_by_its_date}}% of reaching it by {{gate}}); with the account used for Dodam alone the middle date is {{claude_dedicated.after_x1.g_dir.p50}} and the {{pct80}}% date {{claude_dedicated.after_x1.g_dir.p80}} (a chance of {{claude_dedicated.after_x1.p_gate_by_its_date}}%). Whether the dates in the table move is judged after what one account gives in a week has been measured. Dates are moved neither earlier nor later on an assumption that has not been measured.

